    "technique_claimed": "T1134.001",
    "rationale": "As APT-Simulator, cmd.exe started a named-pipe server (CreateNamedPipe.exe 334485) and created service tbbd05 whose binary path echoes into \\\\.\\pipe\\334485; services.exe then ran that command as SYSTEM, so the pipe server can impersonate the SYSTEM token. This is token impersonation through a named pipe from the APT-Simulator account; disable it now."
  },
